# =============================================================================
# CO COMMIT (khong ignore) — de o day cho ro rang:
#   - toan bo ma nguon: squeezedattention/, value_aware/, patches/, scripts/
#   - transformers/ fork da va (modeling_llama.py la trong tam dong gop)
#   - docs/: METHODOLOGY.md, INTEGRATION.md
#   - environment.yml
#   - LongBench/pred_*/**/*.jsonl : KET QUA THAT (~10 MB, la bang chung)
#
# Neu muon repo chi co ma nguon, bo comment dong duoi:
# [CHET] LongBench/pred_*/
# =============================================================================

### === SUA: luat bi neo sai va luat trong-so an ca ket qua ===
# 1) Luat logs/-lim cu bat dau bang "LongBench/" nen bi neo vao thu muc
#    goc va khong bao gio khop. Dung "**/" de khop o moi do sau.
**/LongBench/logs_SQ/
**/LongBench/logs_E1/
**/LongBench/pred_*-lim*/
**/LongBench/data_val/
# 2) Luat  LLaMA-2-7B-32K*/  o tren viet ra de chan trong so model, nhung
#    vi khong co "/" o giua nen no khop o moi do sau — va moi thu muc
#    ket qua deu la pred_*/LLaMA-2-7B-32K_PC5_PERC0.x/ , nen no chan luon
#    het ket qua. Dong duoi tra lai thu muc ket qua, trong so van bi chan
#    (vi *.safetensors / *.bin / *.pt da bi chan rieng o tren).
!**/pred_*/LLaMA-2-7B-32K*/

# 3) --giu-pred: ket qua tho .jsonl DUOC commit lam bang chung.
#    Doi y thi them lai dong:  **/LongBench/pred_*/

# ket qua chay, du lieu, tai lieu rieng: khong dua len GitHub
